1
00:00:22,806 --> 00:00:26,690
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:33,705
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,578 --> 00:00:40,716
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,054 --> 00:00:47,063
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,274 --> 00:00:51,195
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,406 --> 00:00:54,497
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,794 --> 00:00:59,029
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,014 --> 00:01:03,922
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,220 --> 00:01:07,106
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,416 --> 00:01:12,198
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,198 --> 00:01:16,778
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,778 --> 00:01:18,777
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:24,762
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,146 --> 00:01:29,457
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,457 --> 00:01:31,965
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,211 --> 00:01:42,428
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,878 --> 00:01:48,712
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,712 --> 00:01:51,630
=Episode 3=

19
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,120
These should be enough.

20
00:02:04,079 --> 00:02:06,280
Suzhen, smile.

21
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:08,360
You'll scare people off with that frown.

22
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,439
I can't smile right now.

23
00:02:11,639 --> 00:02:12,840
Just smile a little.

24
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,639
Suzhen, the more sincere you are,

25
00:02:19,639 --> 00:02:21,039
the easier it is to touch people.

26
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,599
Just being sincere is enough.

27
00:02:23,159 --> 00:02:24,159
Just like this.

28
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:29,319
Young Master Xu,

29
00:02:31,639 --> 00:02:33,319
for your hand injury,

30
00:02:34,759 --> 00:02:37,639
I went all over the city
to buy the medicine.

31
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,520
Now, I'm giving these

32
00:02:40,439 --> 00:02:41,439
to you.

33
00:02:45,199 --> 00:02:46,520
Alright, Qing.

34
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:48,319
Your turn.

35
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,840
No, Qing, I can't do it.

36
00:03:05,199 --> 00:03:06,199
No, I can't.

37
00:03:06,199 --> 00:03:07,199
- Suzhen.
- Not at all.

38
00:03:07,199 --> 00:03:08,199
Listen to me.

39
00:03:08,719 --> 00:03:09,719
Young Master Xu,

40
00:03:10,759 --> 00:03:12,520
my uncle has wanted
to reclaim this house.

41
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:15,159
If not for my mediation,

42
00:03:15,879 --> 00:03:17,319
you would've been kicked out.

43
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:21,159
Now, I have a solution for you.

44
00:03:21,639 --> 00:03:23,319
This house is where my parents lived.

45
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:25,159
It means a great deal to me.

46
00:03:25,479 --> 00:03:26,560
If you have a solution,

47
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:27,680
please tell me.

48
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,919
When speaking to me, he looks so bitter,

49
00:03:31,919 --> 00:03:33,960
but he's so gentle with this young lady.

50
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:36,360
He treats you like that?

51
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:39,960
Not really.

52
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:50,080
Young Master Xu,
if you become my husband,

53
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,879
my uncle will have no reason
to kick you out.

54
00:03:52,599 --> 00:03:53,599
Miss Lin,

55
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,240
please mind yourself.

56
00:03:55,319 --> 00:03:56,719
Don't you know my feelings?

57
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,159
Since you won't obey me,

58
00:03:58,439 --> 00:04:00,680
then pack your things and get out.

59
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,479
What are you waiting for?

60
00:04:12,479 --> 00:04:13,960
Quick, help me up.

61
00:04:34,399 --> 00:04:35,399
It's you.

62
00:04:36,639 --> 00:04:38,319
You're quite popular, Young Master Xu.

63
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,240
First Wang Erya,

64
00:04:40,439 --> 00:04:42,639
then Miss Lin, and then...

65
00:04:42,639 --> 00:04:43,639
What are you doing here?

66
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:54,879
Weren't you injured?

67
00:04:55,399 --> 00:04:57,879
I specially went all over the city

68
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,399
to get medicine for you...

69
00:04:59,399 --> 00:05:00,399
Thank you for caring.

70
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:02,000
I don't deserve your kindness.

71
00:05:02,519 --> 00:05:03,519
Please go back.

72
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,160
Xu Xian.

73
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,839
I just saw Miss Lin.

74
00:05:09,759 --> 00:05:12,480
Is that old wretch Master Lin
trying to kick you out again?

75
00:05:13,079 --> 00:05:14,079
Come home with me.

76
00:05:14,519 --> 00:05:15,800
Don't take their nonsense.

77
00:05:16,399 --> 00:05:17,399
None of your concern.

78
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:22,720
Xu Xian,

79
00:05:23,639 --> 00:05:25,120
come home with me.

80
00:05:26,759 --> 00:05:30,040
Suzhen, Xu Xian's parents are both gone.

81
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:33,319
By reason, shouldn't he
cherish his only family more?

82
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,800
What's with his attitude?

83
00:05:41,879 --> 00:05:44,959
(Xu Xian, you killed
my sister yesterday.)

84
00:05:45,759 --> 00:05:50,040
(Today, I will make you taste the pain
of losing a loved one.)

85
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,160
Suzhen, come.

86
00:06:10,839 --> 00:06:11,839
You're hurt?

87
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:13,920
It's nothing.

88
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,399
You're a demon hunter too?

89
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,000
Cut the crap.

90
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,120
You hurt my sister.

91
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:42,480
I'll make you pay back tenfold.

92
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,160
(Qing,)

93
00:07:06,639 --> 00:07:07,639
(return quickly.)

94
00:07:25,079 --> 00:07:26,160
How dare you come?

95
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,360
You're courting death!

96
00:07:38,098 --> 00:07:40,912
(Spirit)

97
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:54,079
You two fox demon sisters
kill innocent people.

98
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,560
You should pay with your lives.

99
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:06,759
Xu Xian, you've made too many enemies.

100
00:08:07,279 --> 00:08:08,480
Even if I die,

101
00:08:08,759 --> 00:08:11,000
there will always be those
who come for you.

102
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,720
One day,

103
00:08:13,199 --> 00:08:14,480
you will lose your kin

104
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:15,680
and your beloved

105
00:08:15,839 --> 00:08:16,959
and live in misery.

106
00:09:01,279 --> 00:09:02,279
Where did they go?

107
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:15,639
"Qing and I will escort your aunt home.

108
00:09:16,559 --> 00:09:17,919
You can rest assured."

109
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:22,240
Suzhen, I've finished writing.

110
00:09:28,639 --> 00:09:29,639
Qing,

111
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:32,919
your handwriting
is even worse than mine.

112
00:09:33,279 --> 00:09:34,279
Let's use mine.

113
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:36,600
Not bad looking,

114
00:09:37,039 --> 00:09:40,279
but her handwriting
is really something else.

115
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:47,480
This house is where my parents lived.

116
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:49,200
It means a great deal to me.

117
00:09:49,799 --> 00:09:50,799
If you have a solution,

118
00:09:50,799 --> 00:09:51,799
please tell me.

119
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:58,080
Young Master Xu,

120
00:10:00,399 --> 00:10:01,519
why won't you look at me?

121
00:10:10,679 --> 00:10:12,759
Here, let me toast you.

122
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,200
No need.

123
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:17,360
You said it's about the house.

124
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,120
That's why I came.

125
00:10:20,639 --> 00:10:25,519
But the matter of the house
is entirely up to me.

126
00:10:30,799 --> 00:10:33,759
Miss Lin, please show some restraint.

127
00:10:35,559 --> 00:10:37,320
You keep mentioning restraint.

128
00:10:38,159 --> 00:10:39,519
I'm fine with myself.

129
00:10:41,559 --> 00:10:43,399
If you still want
to talk about the house,

130
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:45,759
drink this cup of wine,

131
00:10:46,039 --> 00:10:47,639
and then I'll start talking business.

132
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:07,120
Can we talk now?

133
00:11:15,879 --> 00:11:16,879
Young Master Xu,

134
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,120
am I beautiful?

135
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,519
Put your clothes on.

136
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:21,919
Young Master Xu.

137
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,240
Young Master Xu.

138
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:32,399
Don't you feel hot all over now?

139
00:11:33,879 --> 00:11:35,279
Need my help?

140
00:11:39,279 --> 00:11:43,679
You've brought this
on yourself, you know.

141
00:11:52,799 --> 00:11:55,919
Are you two honored guests
from the capital?

142
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:58,200
My surname is Zhang.

143
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:00,440
Today, I am passing through
with my wife.

144
00:12:01,519 --> 00:12:04,120
Master Lin, I heard you have
a feng shui treasure land.

145
00:12:05,039 --> 00:12:08,240
Are you referring to
my old house in the suburbs?

146
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:09,720
Exactly.

147
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:12,720
My husband has always
loved peace and quiet

148
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:14,399
and favored natural scenery.

149
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:17,159
If the price is right...

150
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:18,960
We can talk.

151
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:23,960
But there are quite a few people
wanting to buy that property now.

152
00:12:24,639 --> 00:12:27,519
The price can't be too low.

153
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:30,679
At least five hundred taels.

154
00:12:30,679 --> 00:12:31,679
It can't go lower.

155
00:12:32,559 --> 00:12:33,559
Deal.

156
00:12:34,679 --> 00:12:35,679
So straightforward?

157
00:12:36,639 --> 00:12:37,759
Of course, I am.

158
00:12:38,679 --> 00:12:41,600
However, I can only pay
one hundred taels of silver first.

159
00:12:42,279 --> 00:12:45,799
For the remaining silver,
I'll use this jadeite instead.

160
00:12:54,879 --> 00:12:59,279
T-This is jadeite
from Nanxiang House in the capital.

161
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:04,559
So you're willing to go through
with this deal, Master Lin?

162
00:13:04,919 --> 00:13:05,919
Yes, of course.

163
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:08,360
Seeing is believing.

164
00:13:11,279 --> 00:13:13,399
I'll get the deed for you two right now.

165
00:13:17,879 --> 00:13:20,759
Suzhen, once we get the deed,

166
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:23,240
Xu Xian will surely obey you.

167
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:29,080
Please.

168
00:13:45,054 --> 00:13:48,484
(Sign and seal)

169
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:55,720
How could my uncle
sell the house to you?

170
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:58,240
Like it or not,

171
00:13:59,279 --> 00:14:00,279
you have to accept it.

172
00:14:00,639 --> 00:14:01,799
From today onward,

173
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:04,159
this house belongs to Xu Xian.

174
00:14:05,159 --> 00:14:06,360
You've seen the deed.

175
00:14:06,639 --> 00:14:07,639
Now can you get out?

176
00:14:08,799 --> 00:14:11,279
You... you two.

177
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:13,279
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

178
00:15:15,746 --> 00:15:20,124
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

179
00:15:21,667 --> 00:15:27,492
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

180
00:15:28,261 --> 00:15:32,728
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

181
00:15:35,593 --> 00:15:40,034
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

182
00:15:42,230 --> 00:15:46,960
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

183
00:15:48,172 --> 00:15:54,285
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

184
00:15:54,948 --> 00:16:00,730
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

185
00:16:00,730 --> 00:16:06,993
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

186
00:16:07,303 --> 00:16:13,662
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

187
00:16:13,833 --> 00:16:21,200
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

188
00:16:21,485 --> 00:16:27,032
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

189
00:16:27,523 --> 00:16:33,733
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

190
00:16:34,043 --> 00:16:40,816
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

191
00:16:41,813 --> 00:16:47,466
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

192
00:16:48,300 --> 00:16:52,708
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

193
00:16:53,473 --> 00:16:56,061
♪Having ever loved♪
